<ol data-start="89" data-end="363">
<li data-start="89" data-end="141">
<p data-start="92" data-end="141"><strong data-start="92" data-end="122">Use the Media Library path</strong> for your <code data-start="132" data-end="138">.glb</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="142" data-end="249">
<p data-start="145" data-end="249"><strong data-start="145" data-end="177">Fallback to a solid red cube</strong> for testing, in case the mesh doesn’t load yet (handy for debugging).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="250" data-end="363">
<p data-start="253" data-end="363">Be ready for the <strong data-start="270" data-end="294">Simply Static export</strong>, where the URL will be rewritten to a relative path automatically.</p>
</li>
</ol>
