<ol data-start="103" data-end="359">
<li data-start="103" data-end="166">
<p data-start="106" data-end="166"><strong data-start="106" data-end="139">Automatic scaling &amp; centering</strong> of your imported <code data-start="157" data-end="163">.glb</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="167" data-end="231">
<p data-start="170" data-end="231"><strong data-start="170" data-end="202">Fallback to a solid red cube</strong> if the mesh fails to load.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="232" data-end="290">
<p data-start="235" data-end="290">Works with <strong data-start="246" data-end="265">outer wireframe</strong> and <strong data-start="270" data-end="287">pulse effects</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="291" data-end="359">
<p data-start="294" data-end="359">Compatible with your <strong data-start="315" data-end="356">Simply Static → GitHub Pages workflow</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
